{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/311","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/311/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/311/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/311/events","html_url":"https://github.com/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/311","id":6025105510,"node_id":"I_kwDOVFVR088AAAABZx_QZg","number":311,"title":"[消息队列 MQ03] Kafka日志重放：消息读过了，为什么还能重读？","user":{"login":"linhongcun","id":230383104,"node_id":"U_kgDODbteAA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230383104?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun","html_url":"https://github.com/linhongcun","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/linhongcun/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-25T13:44:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-28T05:08:06Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!-- message-queue-series:2026-10-25:mq03 -->\n\n**核心顺序3/9；MQ03仅作稳定题库索引。待定稿，未开拍。** 拟为独立视频及配套图文，无观看硬前置。\n\n## 独立问题与主线\n\n本系列统一Kafka。MQ02聚焦不同group与同组实例的收到归属；本片进一步聚焦日志保留、已提交位置和重放，必要的group概念仍在片内建立，不重复大篇幅拓扑教学。\n\n一条Kafka消息被通知服务读过，积分服务为什么仍能读取？已经读过的数据又怎样重放？\n\n1. 本片自行建立Topic分区是一段追加日志、offset是记录位置、groupId标识独立消费进度的必要模型；同一小组订单事件保持在日志原位。\n2. 两个消费组各自移动游标；在一个传统消费组内分配分区给实例，展示“组间各读一份、组内分工”。\n3. 在记录仍被保留的前提下，停用一组消费者、重置其已提交位置后再启动读取，另一组的进度不变，解释读取不会立即删除日志。\n\n观众应能说明日志、消费组和位点各负责什么，以及重放为什么可能。本片不展开重平衡协议、Exactly Once或消息队列产品优劣比较。\n\n## 专项对照验收\n\n同一组事件分别记录两个groupId的读取位置、业务处理与提交位置；让一组暂停、恢复并回退重读，核对另一组和日志内容未被它的读取动作改变。演示两分区与多于两实例时的分配，不能让同组多个实例同时独占同一分区。\n\n## 边界与资料\n\n固定Kafka传统consumer group；分区独占与实例并发上限不套用于Share Groups。读取、业务完成和提交位点是不同阶段；重放可能再次执行业务，不自动安全重做外部副作用。日志能否重读受保留/清理策略与当前位置影响，不承诺永久保存。RabbitMQ Streams也存在日志模型，不把产品名当作模型的唯一归属。\n\n- [Kafka 4.4 Design](https://kafka.apache.org/44/design/design/)：日志、消费组与保留模型。\n- [Kafka 4.4 Basic Operations](https://kafka.apache.org/44/operations/basic-kafka-operations/)：消费组进度与位点重置。\n- [Kafka 4.4 Topic Configs](https://kafka.apache.org/44/configuration/topic-configs/)：日志保留与清理条件。\n\n公共制作与验收规范统一见[总览#308](https://github.com/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/308)；开工固定实际客户端、消费协议与保留配置。\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/311/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/linhongcun/video-studio/issues/311/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1144995,"client_id":"Iv23liVemv8A9if9v0F2","slug":"chatgpt-codex-connector","node_id":"A_kwHOAOQ6Gs4AEXij","owner":{"login":"openai","id":14957082,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE0OTU3MDgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14957082?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai","html_url":"https://github.com/openai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/openai/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"name":"ChatGPT Codex Connector","description":"Bring ChatGPT and Codex to your GitHub repositories.","external_url":"https://www.chatgpt.com","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/chatgpt-codex-connector","created_at":"2025-02-14T01:37:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-23T18:52:59Z","permissions":{"actions":"write","checks":"read","contents":"write","emails":"read","issues":"write","metadata":"read","pull_requests":"write","statuses":"read","workflows":"write"},"events":["check_run","check_suite","commit_comment","issues","issue_comment","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","pull_request_review_thread","repository","status","sub_issues"]},"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}